<title>JAPAN: TIFFE Euroyen ends lower in Tokyo.</title>
<headline>TIFFE Euroyen ends lower in Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>May 30 settlement  prev settlement</p>
<p> TIFFE Euroyen 3M (Z)     98.85		  98.86</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The key December three-month Euroyen futures contract had dipped slightly to settle lower on Friday after coming under pressure on comments about a possible rate rise by the end of this year from Japanese officials.</p>
<p>But the lingering impact of Thursday's release of weaker-than-expected industrial production data provided support.</p>
<p>Key December settled at 98.85 after moving from 98.85 to 98.91, with a volume of 107,387 contracts.</p>
</text>
